graph TB
    subgraph Client["Client Layer"]
        WebBrowser["Web Browser"]
    end

    subgraph Backend["Backend Services"]
        PlanMgmt["Plan Management"]
        SubTracking["Subscription Tracking"]
        PaymentProc["Payment Processing"]
    end

    subgraph External["External Services"]
        Stripe["Stripe Payment Gateway"]
    end

    subgraph Data["Data Storage"]
        MongoDB["MongoDB Database"]
        Redis["Redis Cache"]
    end

    WebBrowser -->|Plans data| PlanMgmt
    WebBrowser -->|Subscription records| SubTracking
    WebBrowser -->|Payment requests| PaymentProc

    PlanMgmt -->|Store/retrieve| MongoDB
    SubTracking -->|Store/retrieve| MongoDB
    PaymentProc -->|Process payments| Stripe

    Stripe -->|Webhooks| SubTracking
    Stripe -->|Webhooks| PaymentProc

    PlanMgmt -->|Cache| Redis
    SubTracking -->|Cache| Redis

